
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="The established Square to Fourth integration suite for Hospitality, Workforce and Inventory Management." />
    <title>Square to Fourth</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,600;9..40,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #16211d;
            --muted: #65736c;
            --line: rgba(22, 33, 29, 0.13);
            --paper: rgba(255, 255, 252, 0.82);
            --mint: #d9eee3;
            --green: #126a50;
            --orange: #d96831;
            --shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(30, 62, 49, 0.14);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 8% 5%, rgba(217, 238, 227, 0.96), transparent 28rem),
                radial-gradient(circle at 94% 22%, rgba(249, 214, 177, 0.68), transparent 26rem),
                #f6f4ec;
        }

        .shell { width: min(1140px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 26px 0 42px; }

        .topbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }

        .identity, .platform { display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .identity { min-width: 0; gap: 14px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
        .identity img { display: block; height: 28px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; }
        .identity .square-wordmark { width: 107px; }
        .identity .fourth-wordmark { width: 91px; }
        .brand-plus { color: var(--muted); font: 500 0.85rem "DM Mono", monospace; }
        .platform { gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; }
        .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #48a977; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(72, 169, 119, 0.14); }

        main { min-width: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.16fr) minmax(340px, 0.84fr); gap: 28px; align-items: stretch; margin-top: 68px; }

        .intro { min-width: 0; padding: 30px 20px 20px 0; animation: rise 500ms ease-out both; }
        .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--green); font: 500 0.76rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h1 { max-width: 710px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.5vw, 5.85rem); line-height: 0.94; letter-spacing: -0.07em; }
        .lede { max-width: 620px; margin: 24px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.13rem; line-height: 1.65; }

        .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 31px; }
        .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 0 21px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 140ms ease, box-shadow 140ms ease, background 140ms ease; }
        .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .button-primary { background: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(18, 106, 80, 0.2); color: #fff; }
        .button-primary:hover { color: #fff; background: #0b573f; }
        .button-secondary { border-color: var(--line); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.46); color: var(--ink); }

        .access-note { margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgba(18, 106, 80, 0.32); outline-offset: 3px; }

        .suite-strip { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 24px; }
        .suite-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 252, 0.56); color: #385249; font: 500 0.72rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.035em; }
        .suite-pill::before { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); content: ""; }
        .suite-pill:nth-child(2)::before { background: #176b93; }
        .suite-pill:nth-child(3)::before { background: var(--orange); }

        .flow-card { position: relative; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 29px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 25px; background: var(--paper); box-shadow: var(--shadow); animation: rise 500ms 100ms ease-out both; }
        .flow-card::before { position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto; height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), #176b93 52%, var(--orange)); content: ""; }
        .flow-card::after { position: absolute; top: -90px; right: -80px; width: 220px; height: 220px; border: 1px solid rgba(18, 106, 80, 0.1); border-radius: 50%; content: ""; }
        .card-label { position: relative; margin: 0; color: var(--green); font: 500 0.75rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .flow-card h2 { position: relative; margin: 16px 0 25px; font-size: 1.55rem; letter-spacing: -0.045em; }
        .step { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px 1fr; gap: 13px; padding: 15px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
        .step-number { width: 27px; height: 27px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); color: var(--green); font: 500 0.7rem "DM Mono", monospace; }
        .step strong { display: block; font-size: 0.96rem; }
        .step p { margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.45; }
        .security { position: relative; margin-top: 19px; padding: 15px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f0f8f4; color: #36584b; font-size: 0.87rem; line-height: 1.5; }
        .security strong { color: var(--green); }

        .suite { margin-top: 46px; animation: rise 500ms 160ms ease-out both; }
        .suite-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .suite-heading h2 { max-width: 640px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.055em; }
        .suite-heading p { max-width: 390px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; text-align: right; }
        .service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
        .service-card { position: relative; min-height: 252px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; background: rgba(255, 255, 252, 0.68); transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease; }
        .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(30, 62, 49, 0.1); }
        .service-card::before { position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto; height: 4px; background: var(--green); content: ""; }
        .service-card:nth-child(2)::before { background: #176b93; }
        .service-card:nth-child(3)::before { background: var(--orange); }
        .service-card::after { position: absolute; right: -42px; bottom: -58px; width: 132px; height: 132px; border: 1px solid rgba(18, 106, 80, 0.11); border-radius: 50%; content: ""; }
        .service-index { color: var(--green); font: 500 0.72rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
        .service-card:nth-child(2) .service-index { color: #176b93; }
        .service-card:nth-child(3) .service-index { color: var(--orange); }
        .service-card h3 { margin: 29px 0 12px; font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
        .service-card p { position: relative; z-index: 1; flex: 1; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; }
        .service-status { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-top: 19px; color: var(--green); font: 500 0.68rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .service-status::before { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #48a977; content: ""; }

        .handoff { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; margin-top: 43px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(22, 33, 29, 0.12); animation: rise 500ms 180ms ease-out both; }
        .handoff-item { min-height: 142px; padding: 22px; background: #17241f; }
        .handoff-item span { display: block; color: var(--green); font: 500 0.7rem "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .handoff-item:nth-child(2) span { color: #75bde3; }
        .handoff-item:nth-child(3) span { color: #f1a27e; }
        .handoff-item strong { display: block; margin-top: 10px; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
        .handoff-item p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #b9c5bf; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.5; }

        .footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 55px; color: var(--muted); font: 0.75rem "DM Mono", monospace; }

        @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        @media (max-width: 820px) {
            .shell { width: min(100% - 28px, 680px); padding-top: 19px; }
            .platform { display: none; }
            main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 34px; }
            .intro { padding: 10px 0; }
            .flow-card { padding: 23px; }
            .suite-heading { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; }
            .suite-heading p { text-align: left; }
            .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .handoff { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .footer { margin-top: 34px; flex-direction: column; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 520px) {
            .shell { width: calc(100% - 24px); }
            .identity { gap: 9px; }
            .identity img { max-width: 39vw; height: 25px; }
            .identity .square-wordmark { width: 96px; }
            .identity .fourth-wordmark { width: 82px; }
            h1 { max-width: 100%; font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 13vw, 3.15rem); overflow-wrap: break-word; }
            .lede { font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.58; }
            .actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .button { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; padding-inline: 16px; }
            .flow-card { padding: 20px; border-radius: 20px; }
            .flow-card h2 { font-size: 1.38rem; }
            .step { grid-template-columns: 29px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
            .service-card { min-height: 0; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 1ms !important; transition-duration: 1ms !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="shell">
        <header class="topbar">
            <a class="identity" href="/" aria-label="Square to Fourth home">
                <img class="square-wordmark" src="/images/brand/square-black.png" alt="Square" />
                <span class="brand-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                <img class="fourth-wordmark" src="/images/brand/fourth-blue.png" alt="Fourth" />
            </a>
            <div class="platform"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Live platform / ready to onboard</div>
        </header>

        <main>
            <section class="intro">
                <p class="eyebrow">Established Square to Fourth platform</p>
                <h1>Connect Square. Run Fourth.</h1>
                <p class="lede">One established integration suite connecting Square with Fourth Hospitality, Fourth Workforce and Fourth Inventory Management, with client-level configuration, mapping and auditable delivery.</p>
                <div class="suite-strip" aria-label="Available Fourth services">
                    <span class="suite-pill">Fourth Hospitality</span>
                    <span class="suite-pill">Fourth Workforce</span>
                    <span class="suite-pill">Inventory Management</span>
                </div>
                <div class="actions">
                        <a class="button button-primary" href="/Access/Login?returnUrl=%2FClientSetup">Sign in to start setup</a>
                            <a class="button button-secondary" href="/Onboarding">Create client access</a>
                    <a class="button button-secondary" href="#connection-flow">How the connection works</a>
                </div>
                <p class="access-note">
Admin access is required to select the client and begin a Square connection.                </p>
            </section>

            <aside id="connection-flow" class="flow-card" aria-label="Setup flow">
                <p class="card-label">The connection flow</p>
                <h2>One Square connection. Three Fourth service paths.</h2>
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">01</span>
                    <div><strong>Choose the client and services</strong><p>Select the brand, locations and Fourth integration paths required.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">02</span>
                    <div><strong>Connect in Square</strong><p>Square opens its own sign-in and approval screen for the account owner.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <span class="step-number">03</span>
                    <div><strong>Configure and verify</strong><p>Map Square locations and people, test the selected Fourth outputs, then enable delivery.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="security"><strong>What the client needs:</strong> their normal Square login and permission to approve the requested read access. The integration stores renewable tokens, not the client's password.</div>
            </aside>
        </main>

        <section class="suite" aria-labelledby="suite-title">
            <div class="suite-heading">
                <h2 id="suite-title">The complete Square to Fourth suite.</h2>
                <p>Choose the Fourth destinations required for each client. Every service uses the same protected onboarding, mapping, scheduling and audit controls.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <span class="service-index">01 / FOURTH HOSPITALITY</span>
                    <h3>Hospitality Sales</h3>
                    <p>Completed Square orders, tenders, discounts, modifiers and trading-day open/close records delivered through the established Fourth Hospitality sales contract.</p>
                    <span class="service-status">Established integration</span>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <span class="service-index">02 / FOURTH WORKFORCE</span>
                    <h3>Workforce Management</h3>
                    <p>Square team members and completed timecards mapped to Fourth locations and EmployeeNumber values, then delivered through the workforce timesheet flow.</p>
                    <span class="service-status">Established integration</span>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <span class="service-index">03 / FOURTH INVENTORY</span>
                    <h3>Inventory Management</h3>
                    <p>Mapped Square product and sales detail supplied to the client's Fourth Inventory Management workflow, with scheduling, upload status and exception history.</p>
                    <span class="service-status">Configured per client</span>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="handoff" aria-label="Platform assurances">
            <div class="handoff-item">
                <span>Live service</span>
                <strong>Already built</strong>
                <p>The platform exists at squaretofourth.store and is ready for client onboarding and configuration.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="handoff-item">
                <span>Secure access</span>
                <strong>Square-managed OAuth</strong>
                <p>The account owner signs in with Square. Their password is never entered into or stored by this platform.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="handoff-item">
                <span>Operational control</span>
                <strong>Mapped and auditable</strong>
                <p>Client mappings, delivery schedules, run status and exceptions remain visible to authorised operators.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="footer">
            <span>squaretofourth.store</span>
            <span>Square to Fourth integration platform</span>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
